# Select environment local. Login uses existing private adminLogin/adminPassword.

### Login
POST {{auth}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"{{adminLogin}}","password":"{{adminPassword}}"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", String(response.body).trim()); %}

### Services and persisted configuration metadata
GET {{auth}}/admin/services
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Routes including inactive and internal
GET {{auth}}/admin/routes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Operations including effective policies and permissions
GET {{auth}}/admin/services/adaptive-demo/operations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Users and current roles, without password hashes
GET {{auth}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Role catalogue
GET {{auth}}/admin/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Declared permissions and mappings, including unresolved permissions
GET {{auth}}/admin/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Current mode and latest Manager result (does not run a cycle)
GET {{auth}}/admin/adaptive
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Run one cycle in the configured mode; APPLY may synchronize all admitted services
POST {{auth}}/admin/adaptive/poll
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### Read full filter/predicate parameters
GET {{auth}}/admin/route-components
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### OBSERVE for subsequent automatic cycles (does not start a poll)
PUT {{auth}}/admin/adaptive/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"OBSERVE"}

### APPLY for subsequent automatic cycles; review before running
PUT {{auth}}/admin/adaptive/mode
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode":"APPLY"}

### Publish manual route edits using existing Gateway admin JWT API
POST {{gateway}}/actuator/gateway/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
